# Vivado project files
boards/e200/*/antsdre200/*
boards/e200/*/*.hwh
boards/e200/*/*.bit
boards/e200/*/sd/
boards/e200/petalinux_bsp/hardware_project/*.xsa
!boards/e200/*/antsdre200/Makefile
!boards/e200/*/antsdre200/*.v
!boards/e200/*/antsdre200/*.tcl
